        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Renáta Tomanová, Larisa Neiland, Billy Martin, Anne Smith, Stanislav Birner, Arantxa Sánchez Vicario\n- Roles: former professional tennis players\n- Events: 1980 French Open – Mixed Doubles, 1999 WTA Tour Championships – Doubles\n- Places: Czechoslovakia, Soviet Union, Latvia\n\nFacts:\n- Renáta Tomanová was born on 9 December 1954 and is a former professional tennis player from Czechoslovakia.\n- Larisa Savchenko-Neiland, née Savchenko, was born on 21 July 1966 and is a former professional tennis player who represented the Soviet Union and Latvia.\n- At the 1980 French Open mixed doubles event, Billy Martin and Anne Smith won the title by defeating Stanislav Birner and Renáta Tomanová in the final.\n- At the 1999 WTA Tour Championships doubles event, Larisa Neiland and Arantxa Sánchez Vicario eliminated another team in the semifinals.",
